{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"||\"I think relationships are hard cause you have to be a good partner too. Needing to be different goods all at the same time gets complicated.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:05:41.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746097648502702132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"||\"Is Rockman ok now?\"|| Selene asks Leaf","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:10:06.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746098762186752092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"||\"They helped a lot yesterday.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:10:33.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746098876003385474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"smiles at Leaf \"You found faith in yourself.  They may have showed you the path, but you chose to walk it.  That is on you.\"  Then pays attention to Selene \"Every interaction with someone is a relationship.  Right now, we are relating in a fashion.  Those interactions are messy, and complicated.  As you get closer to someone, the mess gets worse, but the reward better.  Right now, I am a bartender that tries to show people the best within themselves, and the best of eachother.  It is a lot to juggle, to track.  But I wouldn't trade one moment of the effort I put in, for the rewards I have gotten out.  When I formally met Liliah, she seems to be debating giving up on this town, she was sad, and broken in a way.  I spent a lot of time and care helping her see the hero within, and the leader she is.  That is value beyond gold.  And someday when I find love, I assure you, it will be even better for me\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:10:34.739000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746098879581257739","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
